Joint (jor): woh jagah jahan do haddiyan ya haddi aur cartilage milti hain. Teen bari qismein: fibrous (na hilne wale), cartilaginous (thore hilne wale) aur synovial (azadi se hilne wale).

Fibrous joints: haddiyan seedhe fibrous connective tissue (zyada tar collagen) se jurti hain. In mein koi harkat nahi hoti. Misalein:
• sutures, jo sirf khopri ki na hilne wali haddiyon ke darmiyan hote hain;
• nichli taang mein tibia aur fibula ke jor;
• jabre ki haddi mein daanton aur un ke socket ke jor.

Cartilaginous joints: haddiyan cartilage ki teh se jurti hain aur thori harkat hoti hai. Do bari qismein:
• hyaline cartilage se jure, maslan pehli pasli aur sternum ka jor;
• fibrocartilage se jure, maslan pelvic girdle ka pubic symphysis aur intervertebral discs.

(i) Disc slip: intervertebral discs jhatka jazb karte aur harkat mein madad dete hain. Herniated ya slipped disc tab hota hai jab disc ki bahari teh phat jaye aur andar ka gel jaisa maada bahar nikal kar qareebi nerves ya spinal cord par dabao dale.
Wajahen: chot, umr ke saath ghisao ya reerh ki haddi par baar baar dabao.
Alamaat: mutasira jagah mein dard, sun hona aur jhunjhunahat, muscle ki kamzori ya kaam na karna, aur shadeed surat mein bowel ya bladder ki kharabi.

(ii) Osteoporosis: haddiyon ki kamzori jis mein woh asani se toot jati hain; bone density kam ho kar haddiyan nazuk aur masaam daar ho jati hain.
Wajahen:
• umr ke saath haddi ki miqdaar ka qudrati ghatna, kuch logon mein zyada;
• aurton mein menopause ke baad oestrogen ki kami se haddi tezi se ghatti hai;
• khurak mein calcium aur vitamin D ki kami (calcium taqat deta hai; vitamin D calcium jazb karwata hai);
• wazan uthane wali warzish ki kami;
• lambe arse tak corticosteroids jaise ilaj;
• smoking aur sharab noshi.
